\u211d) (ha : a \u2265 0) (hb : b \u2265 0) (hc : c \u2265 0) : 8 + 2 * (a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 + c ^ 2) + a * b * c \u2265 5 * (a + b + c)  := by\n  /-\n  We need to prove that for non-negative real numbers \\(a\\), \\(b\\), and \\(c\\), the inequality \\(8 + 2(a^2 + b^2 + c^2) + abc \\geq 5(a + b + c)\\) holds. This can be shown using non-linear arithmetic by considering the non-negativity of squares and other expressions.\n  -/\n  -- Use non-linear arithmetic to prove the inequality by considering the non-negativity of squares and other expressions.\n  nlinarith [sq_nonneg (a + b + c - 3), sq_nonneg (a - 1), sq_nonneg (b - 1), sq_nonneg (c - 1),\n    mul_nonneg ha hb, mul_nonneg hb hc, mul_nonneg hc ha, sq_nonneg (a - b), sq_nonneg (b - c),\n    sq_nonneg (c - a), sq_nonneg (a * b - 1), sq_nonneg (b * c - 1), sq_nonneg (c * a - 1)]\n","values":[-1.0,1.0,-1.0,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.8,0.7741935483870968,0.38095238095238093,0.38095238095238093,0.38095238095238093,0.5,0.5,0.5,-0.75,-0.375,-0.375,-0.375,-0.5625,-0.5625,-0.5625,-0.16666666666666666,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.16666666666666666,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.16666666666666666,-0.25,-0.25,-0.25,-0.16666666666666666,-0.25,-0.25,-0.16666666666666666,-0.25,-0.16666666666666666,-1.0,-0.625,0.6666666666666666,1.0,1.0,-1.0,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,1.0,-1.0,-1.0,-0.23809523809523808,-0.23809523809523808,-0.3125,-0.3125,-0.3125,1.0,1.0,0.25,0.25,0.375,0.375,0.375,0.6666666666666666,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,-1.0,-0.625,0.6666666666666666,1.0,1.0,-1.0,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,1.0,-1.0,-0.23809523809523808,-1.0,-0.23809523809523808,-0.3125,-0.3125,-0.3125,1.0,0.25,1.0,0.25,0.375,0.375,0.375,0.5,0.6666666666666666,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,-1.0,-0.625,0.6666666666666666,1.0,1.0,-1.0,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,1.0,-1.0,-0.23809523809523808,-0.23809523809523808,-1.0,-0.3125,-0.3125,-0.3125,1.0,0.25,0.25,1.0,0.375,0.375,0.375,0.5,0.5,0.6666666666666666,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.25,-0.1111111111111111,-0.5,-0.5,-0.5,-1.0,-1.0,-0.62